    summary_60s: 'Genetically modified crops, resistant plant species and ethical implications of genetic modification. CROP IMPROVEMENT GENETICALLY MODIFIED CROPS (GMC) Genetically modified crops, commonly referred to as GM crops or genetically engineered crops, are plants whose genetic material ',
